  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ICRC operations by the Japan Delegation(2025 Unaudited)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In Japan, the ICRC enhances humanitarian debate, contributes to humanitarian policy and cultivates government support. We work with the Japanese Red Cross on public relations, teaching of IHL, joint operations, mobilizing support for the JRCS and recruiting Japanese delegates for ICRC operations.</narrative>
  </description>
